+// [Housing] 451 ANOMALY DUMPER -- one instrument, many hypotheses. When the
+// FIFO parse hits anything suspicious, print the discriminating context ONCE
+// per drain:
+//   * the owning display list (ptr/size/range) -> H4 bad DL pointer,
+//     H9 raw/unparsed model bytes, H10 which content emitted it
