+// §391b — arm/disarm the PER-DRAW truth probe in populate_pipeline_config.
+//
+// The probe deduplicates by draw signature, so it must be scoped to the moment
+// under investigation: armed unscoped, the boot logo, the title screen and every
+// room walked through on the way would consume the whole signature budget before
+// the room in question drew anything. Arming bumps an epoch, which clears the
+// seen-set on the next draw — so each arming yields exactly one room's draw set.
+//
+// Called by the game side at the same settle point as the §389 room verifier
+// (d_ext_npc_mount.cpp), so the verifier's manifest report and the draw census
+// describe the same frame.
